        ],
        "text": "“先查公用工作区，不凭猜测指责谁。”叶岑提起台边的油灯，借灯光查看柜台台面与下方空间，没有触碰行李架上的寄存物。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:25",
        "eventSequence": 7,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "叶岑向茶桌旁的掌柜问道：“您最后一次见到铜印是什么时候、在哪里？您是否经手过，或把它收放到别处？我想先核实这些，再判断该往哪里找。”",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:player:f9e2c0d3-c064-46e9-ac29-c5e0236f6d99",
        "eventSequence": 8,
        "role": "player",
        "playerConversation": "present",
        "speakerKey": "player",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "嗯，我在听。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:26",
        "eventSequence": 10,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“嗯，你不必参与查找。我先等掌柜回应刚才的问题。”",
        "replyToSequence": 8,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      }
    ],
